6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Oh, don't play dumb with me.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
We're going to the same places as him, right?

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Oh, probably not. That was more like a maybe-we'll-see-each-other kind of situation.

9
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Getting to snap some cool photos out here is enough to make me happy.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Though honestly, seeing him would've been nice.

11
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
You should've made plans. You have to pick a time and a place to hang out.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Don't sit around hoping you'll happen to run into him.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
What? Planning to see him outside of school alone?

14
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
There's no way I could do that.

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Maybe, but that would mean I'd have to leave you by yourself.

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Hm? Wait, for real? That's your reason?

17
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Are you my mom now?

18
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
I'm sorry, I'm just fishing for excuses.

19
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
You're forgiven.

20
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
But you know I can't stand when people tiptoe around the truth.

21
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,000
I know, and I'm sorry.

22
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Hey, what are you ladies talking about?

23
